{"id": "164400", "revid": "2217354", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=164400", "title": "Hyderabad/South", "text": "South Hyderabad is an area south of the Old City of Hyderabad, India. It is home to Rajiv Gandhi International Airport and Himayat Sagar.\nSleep.\nHotels near the airport and within Ramoji Film City can be expensive and unless money is no object, you should try to book a budget hotel in central Hyderabad instead."}
